### Get all categories
GET http://localhost:8080/api/categories


### Get expense by ID
GET http://localhost:8080/api/categories/15


### Create valid expense
POST http://localhost:8080/api/categories
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Groceries"
}

### Delete existing expense
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/categories/15


### Delete missing expense
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/categories/9999